==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Warm Darner}}
Warm Darners can be found in open areas of the [[Akkala Highlands]] and [[Hyrule Field]]. They are also sold by [[Maypin]] and by [[Beedle]] at [[Gerudo Canyon Stable]], [[Rito Stable]], [[Serenne Stable]], and [[Snowfield Stable]]. Combining one with [[Monster Part]]s in a [[Cooking Pot]] will result in a [[Spicy Elixir]], which grants [[Link]] temporary [[Cold Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] accepts Warm Darners as an ingredient for [[Red Dye]].

The [[Side Quest]] "[[Little Sister's Big Request]]" requires Link to gather a Warm Darner and other [[Dragonfly|Dragonflies]] for [[Jana]] as [[Gleema]]'s birthday present.<ref>{{Cite|When I grow up, I wanna travel the world and meet some real {{Color BotW|Blue|dragonflies}}!|Gleema|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|Well, this is her birthday wish... I didn't have a choice.|Jana|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|Bring me a {{Color BotW|Blue|warm darner}}, {{Color BotW|Blue|cold darner}}, and {{Color BotW|Blue|electric darner}}, please.|Jana|BotW}}</ref> However, Jana will become disgusted by the Dragonflies and asks Link to deliver them in her stead.<ref>{{Cite|BAH! I CAN'T DO THIS! Please give them to her...just...give them to Gleema yourself!|Jana|BotW}}</ref> Jana will give Link one hundred [[Rupee]]s upon completing this Quest.

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Warm Darner}}
